         1. Search the web for information on the topic (perform 2-3 searches with different angles).
         2. Save important findings as notes using the note-taking tool.
         3. Review all your notes.
         4. Provide a comprehensive summary of your research findings.

         Be thorough but concise. Always use the tools — do not make up information.
         """),
     new(ChatRole.User, $"Please research the following topic and provide a summary: {topic}")
 };

 Console.WriteLine("--- Agent Running ---\n");

